Description: AIOHD NEXT 3.2.1 Full HD skin for OpenATV / Python 3
 Rebuilt channel details panel with smaller MiniTV, scrolling multi-line EPG,
 four upcoming events, compact InfoBar with separated description/progress, inline weather, three channel-list sizes and in-plugin update checks.
 Fixes clipped OpenATV update/flash/OSD screens. Update checks use stable GitHub Releases and always require user confirmation.
